# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# 👑 KRYLOSMP SEASON 1 — MASTER SYSTEM SKRIPT
# Designed for Krylo & Season 1 Pioneer Beta
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

variables:
    {krylocoins::%player%} = 1000
    {clan::%player%} = "None"
    {bounty::%player%} = 0
    {rank::%player%} = "Member"

# ─── ON FIRST JOIN / LOGIN ───
on join:
    if {krylocoins::%player%} is not set:
        set {krylocoins::%player%} to 1000
        set {clan::%player%} to "None"
        if player is "Krylo_MC" or "Krylo" or "Krylo_plays" or ".Krylo plays" or "Krylo plays":
            set {rank::%player%} to "Owner"
            set {clan::%player%} to "KryloArmy"
            set {krylocoins::%player%} to 1000000
        else:
            set {rank::%player%} to "Member"
        send "&6&lKryloSMP &8» &aWelcome to &e&lKryloSMP Season 1&a!" to player
        send "&6&lKryloSMP &8» &7You received a starter bonus of &e1,000 KryloCoins&7!" to player

    # Auto Owner Tag, Clan & LuckPerms Root
    if player is "Krylo_MC" or "Krylo" or "Krylo_plays" or ".Krylo plays" or "Krylo plays":
        set {rank::%player%} to "Owner"
        set {clan::%player%} to "KryloArmy"
        execute console command "lp user %player% parent set owner"
        execute console command "lp user %player% permission set * true"
        send "&6&lKryloSMP &8» &e👑 Welcome Back Owner %player%! Full permissions loaded." to player

    # Tablist & Scoreboard update
    set player's tab list header to "&6&l👑 KRYLOSMP &8┃ &e&lSEASON 1%nl%&7Server IP: &bkrylosmp.falix.gg:29273"
    set player's tab list footer to "&7Online: &a%number of all players% &8┃ &7Store: &ekrylosmp-store.web.app"

# ─── CHAT FORMATTING ───
on chat:
    if {rank::%player%} is "Owner":
        set chat format to "&4&l[👑 OWNER] &c%player's display name%&8: &f%message%"
    else if {rank::%player%} is "Dev" or {rank::%player%} is "Lead Dev":
        set chat format to "&b&l[🛠️ LEAD DEV] &3%player's display name%&8: &f%message%"
    else if {rank::%player%} is "Tester" or {rank::%player%} is "Beta Tester":
        set chat format to "&d&l[🧪 BETA TESTER] &d%player's display name%&8: &f%message%"
    else if {rank::%player%} is "Director":
        set chat format to "&6&l[⚡ DIRECTOR] &e%player's display name%&8: &f%message%"
    else if {rank::%player%} is "Admin":
        set chat format to "&c&l[🛡️ ADMIN] &c%player's display name%&8: &f%message%"
    else if {rank::%player%} is "Mod" or {rank::%player%} is "Moderator":
        set chat format to "&2&l[⚔️ MOD] &a%player's display name%&8: &f%message%"
    else if {rank::%player%} is "Helper":
        set chat format to "&9&l[🎫 HELPER] &9%player's display name%&8: &f%message%"
    else if {rank::%player%} is "Sovereign":
        set chat format to "&6&l[👑 SOVEREIGN] &e%player's display name%&8: &f%message%"
    else:
        set chat format to "&7%player's display name%&8: &f%message%"

# ─── ECONOMY COMMANDS ───
command /balance [<player>]:
    aliases: /bal, /money, /kc
    trigger:
        if arg-1 is not set:
            send "&6&l[KryloCoins] &7Your wallet balance: &e%{krylocoins::%player%}% KC &6💎" to player
        else:
            send "&6&l[KryloCoins] &e%arg-1%'s &7balance: &e%{krylocoins::%arg-1%}% KC &6💎" to player

command /pay <player> <number>:
    trigger:
        if arg-1 is player:
            send "&cYou cannot pay yourself!" to player
            stop
        if arg-2 is less than 1:
            send "&cEnter a valid positive number!" to player
            stop
        if {krylocoins::%player%} is less than arg-2:
            send "&cInsufficient KryloCoins! You have %{krylocoins::%player%}% KC." to player
            stop
        remove arg-2 from {krylocoins::%player%}
        add arg-2 to {krylocoins::%arg-1%}
        send "&6&l[KryloCoins] &7You sent &e%arg-2% KC &7to &a%arg-1%&7!" to player
        send "&6&l[KryloCoins] &7You received &e%arg-2% KC &7from &a%player%&7!" to arg-1

command /eco <text> <player> <number>:
    permission: op
    trigger:
        if arg-1 is "give" or "add":
            add arg-3 to {krylocoins::%arg-2%}
            send "&aGave %arg-3% KC to %arg-2%! New balance: %{krylocoins::%arg-2%}% KC" to player
        else if arg-1 is "take" or "remove":
            remove arg-3 from {krylocoins::%arg-2%}
            send "&cRemoved %arg-3% KC from %arg-2%! New balance: %{krylocoins::%arg-2%}% KC" to player
        else if arg-1 is "set":
            set {krylocoins::%arg-2%} to arg-3
            send "&eSet %arg-2%'s KC to %arg-3%!" to player

# ─── SPAWN & RTP COMMANDS ───
command /setspawn:
    permission: op
    trigger:
        set {krylo::spawn} to player's location
        send "&6&l[KryloSMP] &aSpawn location saved at your current position!" to player

command /spawn:
    trigger:
        if {krylo::spawn} is set:
            teleport player to {krylo::spawn}
            send "&6&l[KryloSMP] &aTeleported to Server Spawn!" to player
        else:
            send "&cSpawn location has not been set yet! Use /setspawn as OP." to player

command /rtp:
    cooldown: 60 seconds
    cooldown message: &cPlease wait %remaining time% before using /rtp again!
    trigger:
        set {_x} to random integer between -2500 and 2500
        set {_z} to random integer between -2500 and 2500
        set {_loc} to location at {_x}, 120, {_z} in world "world"
        teleport player to {_loc}
        send "&6&l[KryloSMP] &aTeleported into the wilderness! (X: %{_x}%, Z: %{_z}%)" to player

# ─── CRATES & GACHA ───
command /crates:
    aliases: /crate, /gacha
    trigger:
        send "&6━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━" to player
        send "&6&l   👑 KRYLOSMP MYSTERY CRATES" to player
        send "&6━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━" to player
        send "&e• /buycrate standard &7— Costs &e2,500 KC" to player
        send "&6• /buycrate mythic &7— Costs &e10,000 KC" to player
        send "&6━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━" to player

command /buycrate <text>:
    trigger:
        if arg-1 is "standard":
            if {krylocoins::%player%} is less than 2500:
                send "&cYou need 2,500 KC for a Standard Crate! Check /bal." to player
                stop
            remove 2500 from {krylocoins::%player%}
            give player 16 iron ingot
            give player 16 cooked beef
            give player 4 diamond
            send "&a&l[CRATE UNBOXED] &7You received &e16 Iron, 16 Steaks, and 4 Diamonds&7!" to player
        else if arg-1 is "mythic":
            if {krylocoins::%player%} is less than 10000:
                send "&cYou need 10,000 KC for a Mythic Crate! Check /bal." to player
                stop
            remove 10000 from {krylocoins::%player%}
            give player 1 netherite ingot
            give player 8 enchanted golden apple
            give player 1 diamond sword of sharpness 5
            broadcast "&6&l[MYTHIC CRATE] &e%player% &7just opened a &6Mythic Crate &7and pulled &dNetherite & God Apples&7!"
        else:
            send "&cUsage: /buycrate standard OR /buycrate mythic" to player

# ─── CLAN SYSTEM ───
command /clan [<text>] [<text>]:
    trigger:
        if arg-1 is not set or arg-1 is "help":
            send "&6━━━━━━━━━━ 🏰 KRYLOSMP CLANS ━━━━━━━━━━" to player
            send "&e/clan create <tag> &7— Create your clan (Costs 5,000 KC)" to player
            send "&e/clan invite <player> &7— Invite player to your clan" to player
            send "&e/clan info &7— View your clan info" to player
            send "&e/clan deposit <amount> &7— Deposit coins into clan vault" to player
            send "&6━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━" to player
        else if arg-1 is "create":
            if arg-2 is not set:
                send "&cSpecify a clan tag! Example: /clan create KRYLO" to player
                stop
            if {krylocoins::%player%} is less than 5000:
                send "&cYou need 5,000 KC to create a clan!" to player
                stop
            remove 5000 from {krylocoins::%player%}
            set {clan::%player%} to arg-2
            set {clanvault::%arg-2%} to 0
            broadcast "&6&l[CLANS] &e%player% &7has founded a new clan: &6[%arg-2%]&7!"
        else if arg-1 is "deposit":
            set {_amt} to arg-2 parsed as number
            if {_amt} is less than 1:
                send "&cEnter a valid number!" to player
                stop
            if {krylocoins::%player%} is less than {_amt}:
                send "&cInsufficient KC balance!" to player
                stop
            set {_c} to {clan::%player%}
            if {_c} is "None":
                send "&cYou are not in a clan! Create one with /clan create." to player
                stop
            remove {_amt} from {krylocoins::%player%}
            add {_amt} to {clanvault::%{_c}%}
            send "&aDeposited %{_amt}% KC into clan [%{_c}%] vault! (Total: %{clanvault::%{_c}%}% KC)" to player

# ─── RANK ASSIGNMENT COMMAND (FOR OP / OWNER) ───
command /setrank <player> <text>:
    permission: op
    trigger:
        set {rank::%arg-1%} to arg-2
        send "&aSet %arg-1%'s rank to %arg-2%!" to player
        send "&6&lKryloSMP &8» &aYour in-game rank was updated to: &e%arg-2%&a!" to arg-1

# ─── CUSTOM KRYLOSMP BROADCAST & SAY COMMANDS (PREFIX: KryloSMP) ───
command /ksay <text>:
    permission: op
    trigger:
        broadcast "&6&lKryloSMP &8» &f%colored arg-1%"

command /say <text>:
    permission: op
    trigger:
        broadcast "&6&lKryloSMP &8» &f%colored arg-1%"

command /broadcast <text>:
    aliases: /bc, /announcement, /announce
    permission: op
    trigger:
        broadcast ""
        broadcast "&6&l━━━━━━━━━━ ✦ KryloSMP ANNOUNCEMENT ✦ ━━━━━━━━━━"
        broadcast " &f%colored arg-1%"
        broadcast "&6&l━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━"
        broadcast ""
